        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, Yehova hakwilisha iseki diikali damukunkulwayi, diikalimahembi, hakudikuvumika, ashakamamu hakuyimwaŋa mwa-mwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakekala chaduwu antu dichi chaduwu niatupristu; chaduwu anduŋu amayala dichi chaduwu niankaka jawu amayala; chaduwu anduŋu awambandadichi chaduwu niankaka jawu awambanda; chaduwu akwakulanda dichi chaduwu niakwakulandisha; chaduwu akwakusondamisha dichichaduwu niakwakusondama; chaduwu akwakudya nŋalanyi dichi chaduwuni adiilawu nŋalanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseki dakekala dakadi chuma nichanti, dakisika dehi chikupu, muloŋa Yehova nahoshi dehi yumiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseki hidikudishona, hidikulepuka, mpata yamunu mwishina hiyikuzeela, hiyikulepuka, akwakudi mujola ahanu heseki hiyakuzeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseki dinatami kwishina dawantu ashakamahu; muloŋa anamotoki dehi nshimbi, anabalumuni dehi lushimbi, anajahi dehi chitiyaŋenu chahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ishiŋu dinadyi dehi iseki, ashakamamu anatanyi dehi; dichi akwakushakama heseki anasukumi dehi, hanashali dehi antu antesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vinyu yayiha hiyikudishona, nyivinyu hiyikuzeela, antu ejima akweti nyichima yazaŋajala hiyakudishishimona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunatiyi tumina kwakumina iseki twakwila nawu, Waloŋa ekali nalubanji. Ilaŋa mi nelili nami, Nakosi, nakosi, iyayami nshona! Akwakukwatila akwawu makasu anakwatili akwawu makasu, mwalala akwakukwatila akwawu makasu anakwatili akwawu makasu nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwoma, niwina, nimuhetu, yinakuwani eyi mukwakushakama heseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakelayenowu wakatemuka woma wamuswalu wakaholokela muwina; wakafuma muwina wakafwa mumuhetu, muloŋa njanina jamwiwulu jakenzuluka, nihashimatila iseki hakanyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseki dinahumuki dehi chikupu, dinasuŋunuki chakusuŋunuka, iseki hidikupedaŋala chakupedaŋala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseki dakatedaŋala neyi muntu nasheti walwa, dakasenkenya niniku niniku neyi kafumbafumba, muloŋa wadu wakalemenahu; dakadimbuka, hidakanya mukanawa cheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu Yehova wakababesha izaza dawakwewulu, hewulu, nianyanta ahanu heseki, heseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akayipompesha hamu, neyi chapompeshaŋwu ankoli muwina, akayenzelela mukaleya, neyi munahiti dehi mafuku amavulu akaya nakuyihempula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakweji kakabaya, itaŋwa dakatiya nsonyi; muloŋa Yehova wamazaza wakekala Mwanta hampidi yaZiyona, nimuYerusalema, ni kumesu awantu indi awawakulumpi chakulema hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
